OL,3,AMore than #2m spent by government on
OL,4,Ainfluencers since July 2024
OL,5,
OL,6,FDepartments said using influencers
OL,7,Fhelped the government to reach people
OL,8,Fwho may be harder to engage through
OL,9,Ftraditional channels, with content
OL,10,Fcreators paid fairly for their time and
OL,11,Fexpertise.
